of Directors for the Corporation </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Reference is hereby made to the Exchange Agreement, dated as of [&#9679;], 2023 (as amended from time to time, the
