given to them in the Exchange Agreement. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The undersigned Holder hereby transfers the number of Sub Shares in Exchange for Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares to
be issued in its name as set forth below, or the Cash Exchange Payment, as applicable, as set forth in the Exchange Agreement. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Legal Name of
